xt{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{2}) & =0 \\\\ {x}^{2}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+y\\cdot 2x & =0 \\\\ {x}^{2}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+2xy & =0 \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =-\\frac{2xy}{{x}^{2}} \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =-\\frac{2y}{x}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe slope of the tangent at the point $(1,\\,-1)$ is then given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m & ={(\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x})}_{(1,\\,-1)} \\\\  & ={(-\\frac{2y}{x})}_{(1,\\,-1)} \\\\  & =-\\frac{2\\cdot (-1)}{1} \\\\  & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533856 true] [17592186255876 1000 #edb/ref 17592186255877 13194139533856 true] [17592186255876 1000 #edb/ref 17592186255878 13194139533856 true] [17592186255876 1000 #edb/ref 17592186255879 13194139533856 true] [17592186255876 1000 #edb/ref 17592186255880 13194139533856 true] [17592186255876 1000 #edb/ref 17592186255881 13194139533856 true] [17592186255876 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533856 true] [17592186255876 1041 "selection" 13194139533856 true] [17592186255876 1104 #edb/ref 17592186255877 13194139533856 true] [17592186255876 1110 #uuid "13be0153-e06b-582a-8134-73dab919400c" 13194139533856 true] [17592186255877 1034 "2" 13194139533856 true] [17592186255877 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533856 true] [17592186255877 1111 #uuid "7aa27835-773a-507b-b9a4-b037a51179df" 13194139533856 true] [17592186255878 1034 "1" 13194139533856 true] [17592186255878 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533856 true] [17592186255878 1111 #uuid "6544c4ee-6b5a-5b70-98fa-27063b586f84" 13194139533856 true] [17592186255879 1034 "0" 13194139533856 true] [17592186255879 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533856 true] [17592186255879 1111 #uuid "ffc56c95-4ba5-5d0f-9ff9-e937f52c3f79" 13194139533856 true] [17592186255880 1034 "-1" 13194139533856 true] [17592186255880 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533856 true] [17592186255880 1111 #uuid "a226a6d2-1362-5548-9c31-88ddaa628f87" 13194139533856 true] [17592186255881 1034 "-2" 13194139533856 true] [1759