y & =10\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the coordinates of $P$ are $(0,\\,10).$" 13194139533856 true] [17592186255883 1000 #edb/ref 17592186255884 13194139533856 true] [17592186255883 1000 #edb/ref 17592186255885 13194139533856 true] [17592186255883 1000 #edb/ref 17592186255886 13194139533856 true] [17592186255883 1000 #edb/ref 17592186255887 13194139533856 true] [17592186255883 1000 #edb/ref 17592186255888 13194139533856 true] [17592186255883 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533856 true] [17592186255883 1041 "selection" 13194139533856 true] [17592186255883 1104 #edb/ref 17592186255888 13194139533856 true] [17592186255883 1110 #uuid "3eaac560-d733-5230-9f9d-912c943df198" 13194139533856 true] [17592186255884 1034 "(0,15)" 13194139533856 true] [17592186255884 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533856 true] [17592186255884 1111 #uuid "3aef06b2-7005-55ee-b236-587964e2d753" 13194139533856 true] [17592186255885 1034 "(0,12)" 13194139533856 true] [17592186255885 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533856 true] [17592186255885 1111 #uuid "fb6c25d9-e6a8-5177-a8ef-52a0e44e7424" 13194139533856 true] [17592186255886 1034 "(0,14)" 13194139533856 true] [17592186255886 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533856 true] [17592186255886 1111 #uuid "33b93caf-b4ed-55a2-ad0f-2856277a617a" 13194139533856 true] [17592186255887 1034 "(0,9)" 13194139533856 true] [17592186255887 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533856 true] [17592186255887 1111 #uuid "e6f6ea62-9cac-500f-b3ba-24923a5dbed5" 13194139533856 true] [17592186255888 1034 "(0,10)" 13194139533856 true] [17592186255888 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533856 true] [17592186255888 1111 #uuid "c576687f-4099-56aa-b62a-4a59e5d3cbd3" 13194139533856 true] [17592186255889 1017 #edb/ref 17592186255890 13194139533856 true] [17592186255889 1089 "q-72260" 13194139533856 true] [17592186255889 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533856 true] [17592186255889 1100 "Calculate $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ for ${x}^{2}y+4y=2{x}^{3}.$